{"id":"vod_sn_37622","vodId":"37622","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"苍蓝钢铁的琶音","name_cn":"苍蓝钢铁的琶音","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/7486d8d66edd0ac7750c6f43ebd596cf.jpg"},"summary":"故事发生在二十一世纪初叶，全球气候持续变暖，融化的冰山淹没了大部分陆地，与此同时，名为“雾之舰队”的战舰群从天而降占领了海域，人类的生存空间逐渐遭到蚕食。千早群像（兴津和幸 配音）是一名士官候补生，某日，一艘名为“伊401”的潜水艇出现在了她的面前。就这样，群像成为了潜水艇的驾驶员。　　皮肤黝黑大大咧咧的橿原杏平（宫下荣治 配音）、温婉可人足智多谋的八月一日静香（东山奈央 配音）、带着面具十分神秘的织部僧（松本忍 配音），活泼可爱身手敏捷的四月一日伊织（津田美波 配音），一群怀抱着拯救人类之重大理想的战友们聚集到了潜水艇之中，为了夺回本该属于人类的领地和敌人展开了激烈的战斗。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:54:01","playable":true,"episodeCount":25,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/bkB8y9AYUE1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gEWQTWaVpp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fYMnkWAewq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uEtxu00Dyr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qtUhHpVyr71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/zutgNzw5mT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/raJy5dkES91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VWVs1aY8kL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/M9q7sR03X81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/u9b6bJ8U7Q1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/pFbQpywtvu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8pesTfVqJp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RGgrwdd6aY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/AKtuBm2xfQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"nam